  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "# Edge to Cloud Broker Bridge — production TLS replacement\n\nThis optional notebook contains one executable production alternative. Run it on the **edge broker** instead of the `EdgeToCloudBridge` local demo Route in `edge-cloud-bridge.lotnb`. It does not replace the Models, Actions, or cloud Rules.\n\nSee README **Production readiness** for the full operator checklist. Maintainers: `AUTHORING.md`.\n\n## Replaces\n\n| Demo definition | Production replacement |\n|---|---|\n| `EdgeToCloudBridge` (plain MQTT, Compose hostname) | `EdgeToCloudBridgeTls` (TLS + mTLS paths, env/secret host and credentials) |\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Cloud users `bridge_site_plant` and `dashboard_site` already created\n- Cloud Rules from the solution notebook already deployed\n- Edge Models and Actions already deployed\n- CA and client certificates mounted into the edge broker container\n- On the **edge** broker, set (via `$SYS/Coreflux/Command`):\n  - `-setEnv CLOUD_BROKER_HOST=<bare hostname, no scheme>`\n  - `-setSecret BRIDGE_SITE_PLANT_PASSWORD=<bridge user password>`\n  - `-setSecret BRIDGE_CLIENT_CERT_PASS=<client cert passphrase>`\n\n## Safe deployment order\n\n1. Cloud Rules first (already done).\n2. Mount certs; set env and secrets on the edge.\n3. Run this TLS Route cell. Do not also run the local demo Route with the same site mapping.\n\nRollback: remove or disable `EdgeToCloudBridgeTls` and restore the last known-good Route definition."
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "Store the host **without** a URL scheme (`//` is a comment character in the secret store; keep hosts in env anyway). Mount certs into the edge container and point the paths below at those files.\n\n> Requires a real TLS endpoint and certificates; skip in the local Compose demo."
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "lot",
    "value": "DEFINE ROUTE EdgeToCloudBridgeTls WITH TYPE MQTT_BRIDGE\n    ADD SOURCE_CONFIG\n        WITH BROKER SELF\n    ADD DESTINATION_CONFIG\n        WITH BROKER_ADDRESS GET ENV \"CLOUD_BROKER_HOST\"\n        WITH BROKER_PORT '8883'\n        WITH CLIENT_ID \"edge-site-plant-bridge-tls\"\n        WITH USERNAME \"bridge_site_plant\"\n        WITH PASSWORD GET SECRET \"BRIDGE_SITE_PLANT_PASSWORD\"\n        WITH USE_TLS \"true\"\n        WITH ALLOW_UNTRUSTED_CERTS \"false\"\n        WITH SERVER_CA_CERT_PATH \"/certs/ca.pem\"\n        WITH CLIENT_CERT_PATH \"/certs/client.pem\"\n        WITH CLIENT_CERT_PASS GET SECRET \"BRIDGE_CLIENT_CERT_PASS\"\n        WITH RECONNECTION_RETRIES '20'\n    ADD MAPPING siteFactoryOutTls\n        WITH SOURCE_TOPIC \"factory/#\"\n        WITH DESTINATION_TOPIC \"sites/site-plant/factory/#\"\n        WITH DIRECTION \"out\""
  }
]
